  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nConsider R as '×'\n\nConsider S as '-'\n\nConsider T as '+'\n\nSo,\n\n8 R 4 S 3 T 2 = 31\n\n→ __**8 × 4**__ - 3 + 2 = 31\n\n→ __**32 + 2**__ - 3 = 31\n\n→ __**34 - 3**__ = 31\n\n→ 31 = 31 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n19 R 11 S 30 T 8 = 187\n\n→ __**19 × 11**__ - 30 + 8 = 187\n\n→ __**209 **____**+ 8**__ - 30 = 187\n\n→ __**217 - 20**__ = 187\n\n→ 187 = 187 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n6 R 3 S 8 T 5 = ?\n\n→ __6 × 3__ - 8 + 5 = ?\n\n→ __18 ____+ 5__ - 8 = ?\n\n→ __23 - 8__ = ?\n\n→ **15 = ?**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"15\".",
